("api/gauge" :names ("gauge") :kind :class :kind-name "Class" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Parent-owned progress indicator; supports inherited window operations. Positive range, value from zero through range, horizontal or vertical orientation. IDs, position, size, validator and native name use wxWidgets defaults; custom styles, taskbar progress and two-step creation remain unbound." :position 18776)
("api/gauge-range" :names ("gauge-range" "(setf gauge-range)") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Read or assign the maximum progress. Assignment clamps the current native value to the new range and restores determinate mode by calling SetRange followed by SetValue. After a pulse the preserved value is platform-dependent; explicitly set GAUGE-VALUE when resuming measured work." :position 20583)
("api/gauge-value" :names ("gauge-value" "(setf gauge-value)") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Read determinate progress. After PULSE-GAUGE the reading is platform-dependent; do not interpret it as completed work. Assigning a value restores determinate mode without events." :position 22250)
