("api/make-label" :names ("make-label") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Thin factory over MAKE-INSTANCE; validates :CLASS against the factory's widget kind and forwards initargs. Create static text; wxWidgets label/mnemonic syntax is retained." :position 37290)
