("api/on-toggle" :names ("on-toggle") :kind :generic-function :kind-name "Generic Function" :package "WXLAMBDA" :summary "Replace and release any prior handler. Receive :TOGGLE snapshots with boolean state. Callback conditions never unwind through C++; they are re-signaled at a Lisp boundary." :position 51104)
